          "line": 42,
          "text": "! JO9 MOD START INDIE_EVENT_FULLIMAGE_20261023 | 2026-10-23_indie_event_fullimage"
        },
        {
          "line": 43,
          "text": " ! Resolve only a known default/role alias for this ID; do not rewrite actor caches."
